    'lang_199' => 'How do I create a menu with a barcode?',
    'lang_2' => 'Introductory video',
    'lang_20' => 'As soon as the customer directs his mobile camera at the barcode, it turns into the menu directly',
    'lang_200' => 'The method of creating an electronic menu is simpler than you can imagine! Watch the previous video above for a detailed explanation from opening an account to uploading and publishing the barcode.',
    'lang_202' => 'The word menu is a literal translation of "menu" in English and means "list" and is usually used to describe the menu of stores, so we say "store menu" or "store menu" etc.',
    'lang_203' => 'How do I make a song barcode on a mobile phone?',
    'lang_204' => 'Unfortunately, this platform is dedicated to designing a barcode menu for stores, cafes and stores only and does not support making a song barcode on a mobile phone.',
    'lang_205' => 'Is it possible to make a free electronic menu on this platform?',
    'lang_206' => 'Yes, it is possible to make a menu for stores, cafes and even stores and others for free within the free plan or the trial plan without having to pay Fees.',
    'lang_207' => 'Can I edit the menu without affecting the QRcode?',
    'lang_208' => 'Yes, the menu can be edited completely without affecting the QRcode, and the QRcode can be printed from the control panel at any time within the specified courses.',
    'lang_209' => 'Can an electronic menu be created for productive families?',
    'lang_21' => 'There is a digital QR barcode for each menu, in addition to a link to share the menu via social media.',
    'lang_210' => 'Yes, productive families are the core and foundation and the reason for proposing the idea of converting the order to WhatsApp to process orders more efficiently.',
    'lang_211' => 'Does the menu support converting the order to WhatsApp?',
    'lang_212' => 'Yes, juwri is the first Arab platform to propose the idea of converting the order to WhatsApp! This feature is available in specific plans, so please review the plans above.',
    'lang_213' => 'Is the electronic menu only for stores?',
    'lang_214' => 'No, the electronic menu is available for all commercial activities and productive families, including but not limited to stores, cafes, hotels, food trucks, health centers, salons, exhibitions, hospitals, companies and institutions, etc.',
    'lang_215' => 'Our latest releases, the plan ',
