    'a_bold_snack_app_menu_clean_white_screens_chunky_black_capsule_buttons_and_a_neon_lime_accent_giant_quantity_counters_and_a_punchy_courier_tracking_flow_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'A bold snack-app menu — clean white screens, chunky black capsule buttons and a neon-lime accent, giant quantity counters and a punchy courier tracking flow. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'an_ultra_clean_ios_style_menu_bright_white_surfaces_a_soft_peach_hero_blur_and_a_confident_orange_accent_floating_pill_navigation_and_crisp_inter_type_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'An ultra-clean iOS-style menu — bright white surfaces, a soft peach hero blur and a confident orange accent, floating pill navigation and crisp Inter type. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'a_vivid_consumer_food_app_warm_orange_feature_cards_sunny_yellow_accents_and_fresh_green_highlights_playful_poppins_type_and_a_friendly_rewards_forward_feel_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'A vivid consumer food app — warm orange feature cards, sunny yellow accents and fresh green highlights, playful Poppins type and a friendly rewards-forward feel. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'an_editorial_minimal_menu_light_gray_canvas_crisp_white_cards_playfair_serif_headings_over_tiny_gray_sans_gold_star_ratings_and_black_pill_buttons_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'An editorial minimal menu — light-gray canvas, crisp white cards, Playfair serif headings over tiny gray sans, gold star ratings and black pill buttons. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'a_bold_black_and_yellow_ice_cream_menu_huge_product_titles_punchy_swatch_based_options_clear_stock_states_and_a_confident_dark_catalog_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'A bold black-and-yellow ice-cream menu — huge product titles, punchy swatch-based options, clear stock states and a confident dark catalog. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'a_dark_lounge_menu_deep_slate_and_plum_surfaces_elevated_tab_pills_on_photo_discount_chips_and_a_refined_pay_tile_set_in_smooth_mulish_type_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'A dark lounge menu — deep slate and plum surfaces, elevated tab pills, on-photo discount chips and a refined pay tile, set in smooth Mulish type. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
    'a_clean_lime_green_storefront_menu_bright_white_cards_on_a_warm_beige_stage_black_icon_circles_and_vivid_lime_call_to_action_bars_with_a_tidy_size_selector_mobile_first_fully_responsive_complete_rtl_support' => 'A clean lime-green storefront menu — bright white cards on a warm beige stage, black icon circles and vivid lime call-to-action bars with a tidy size selector. Mobile-first, fully responsive, complete RTL support.',
